  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• In a large frying pan, heat with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook arborio rice and garlic & herb seasoning until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in passata, vegetable stock, the water and brown sugar. Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83dc70d0527cba53a83cf/step-c0ab3500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer rice mixture to a baking dish.\n• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83dc70d0527cba53a83cf/step-5500c010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop carrot. Trim and slice green beans into thirds. Finely chop garlic.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and green beans until just tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83dc70d0527cba53a83cf/step-6742d420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83dc70d0527cba53a83cf/step-c8d10730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once risotto has finished baking, remove from oven and stir through baby spinach leaves, cooked chicken and veggies, until wilted and combined.\n• Stir through a splash of water to loosen rice if needed. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83dc70d0527cba53a83cf/step-3c93df40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby tomato risotto between bowls. Top with crumbed chick'n.\n• Garnish with a pinch of chilli flakes. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83dc70d0527cba53a83cf/step-a2da6f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
